title: "diabetes-xai-agreement"
abstract: >-
  Research pipeline auditing explainable AI methods (SHAP vs Permutation
  Importance) on population-scale diabetes risk prediction from CDC BRFSS
  data (2015, 2021, 2023), using a computed-ABC partition of ranked
  feature importance.
